### star-plan-executor/SKILL.md
--- 1
**The report is not the end of the turn.** With its text out, start `star-code-reviewer` on this leaf in the same reply — the `Skill` tool, `star-code-reviewer` as the skill and the leaf as its argument, the way Step 5 dispatches an `Agent` — to audit the implementation against the conventions and the sub-plan. It is one of the eight skills the agent may start and its target is the leaf this run just executed, so it is a run rather than a line of text: a command printed to the agent itself is a handoff to nobody (conventions §10.6). This is the run's last action in either ending — after a completed run, before revising or moving on; and before the user runs a command handed back at the STOP line.
